     "text": ", old enough to breed if capable of it, but the male not come to his full beauty as yet. The two species well combined. Neck intermediate in colouring, and facial skin white, with a large yellow spot. Crest intermediate, thus, \n    \n        \n     \nthe feathers [subeven]. The same native has also the Blue and ",
